    <string name="wiz_s2_body">Settings → Developer options → turn on “ADB debugging”, then “Wireless debugging”. Make sure the watch is on the same Wi‑Fi as this phone.</string>
    <string name="wiz_s3_title">Pair with the watch</string>
    <string name="wiz_s3_body">On the watch tap “Wireless debugging” → “Pair new device”. Type the 6‑digit code you see there.</string>
